        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 687DA, Dakota Single Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSecurity with flair, the clean lines of the Dakota Handleset lend a casual ambiance to your entry door. The Dakota 687DA Single Cylinder grade 3 door entrance lockset has a lifetime mechanical and finish warranty from Kwikset. This handleset is made by Kwikset who has been a leader in the residential door hardware for more than 60 years. It is made for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. This two piece oval mount entryset make it great for traditional decor.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> the latchbolt is operated by a thumbpiece outside and grip inside. The deadbolt is operated by a key outside and a thumbturn inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src =\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-Finish-5.jpg?v=1704354507\" width=\"213\" height=\"165\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Single Cylinder Function Chart\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Dakota 687DA Two Piece Single Cylinder Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>5 Pin cylinder lock</li>\r\n<li>1\" deadbolt throw</li>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.5 Grade 3</li>\r\n<li>Sold as a complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>All metal mechanics.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Oval Dakota Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 17-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Crossbore: 2-1/8\" or 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Crossbore: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" doors.</li>\r\n<li>Crossbore Hole Spacing: 5-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Handing: please specify</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Dakota Single Cylinder Handleset, Kwikset 687DA",
                "description": "Dakota Single Cylinder Handleset Kwikset 687DA - Security with flair, the clean lines of the Dakota Handleset lend a casual ambiance to your entry door. The Dakota 687DA Single Cylinder grade 3 door entrance lockset has a lifetime mechanical and finish warranty from Kwikset. This handleset is made by Kwikset who has been a leader in the residential door hardware for more than 60 years. It is made for doors up to 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. This two piece oval mount entryset make it great for traditional decor.",
